WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:33.100
My lost memories led to Egypt 3,000 years ago.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.530
Where Bakura and I begin our battle.

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:44.640
Bakura, I won't forgive you for looting and killing people!

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:48.300
But I don't know where Bakura fled to.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:53.200
Meanwhile, Mahad left to guard the Pharaoh's tomb...

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:59.200
Battle to the Death!  Mahad vs Bakura

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:11.320
The entrance is sealed!

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:13.390
The bandit can't escape!

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:14.610
Raise the tablet!

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:24.660
When a Ka appears in the tablet, we're ordered to seal this place for eternity.

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:28.060
Mahad is willing to risk his life.

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:33.670
Slay anyone who tries to interfere so that he can focus on his battle!

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.600
Even if we must die!

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:56.240
I’ve been waiting for you, Bakura!

00:02:57.220 --> 00:02:59.220
How nice of you.

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:03.260
You must really want to give me that Millennium Ring.

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:06.270
You won't get my Millennium Ring,

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:10.700
And you can no longer leave here alive!

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:16.370
Big talk for a mere spellcaster.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:19.810
I'll say it again!  You can no longer leave!

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:27.250
I'll use all of my magical power - my Heka - in this battle!

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:30.360
This guy...

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:35.170
We spellcasters have honed our skills here for generations.

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:38.300
And this place will serve as your grave!

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:40.220
We'll see about that.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:44.110
Come out, Diabound!

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:53.620
His Ka - Diabound - has changed form!

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:58.560
The more I’m filled with rage, the further Diabound evolves.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:04.910
I’ll use my Heka to summon Illusion Magician!

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:17.550
I see that your Ka has also powered up.

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:21.070
But it’s still no match for my Diabound.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:23.440
Want to test that, Bakura?

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:24.510
Diaha!

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:27.520
Here I go!  Diabound attacks!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.540
Poison Fang Barrage!

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.860
It got behind me?

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:41.300
Illusion Magician attacks!

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.010
Magical Shockwave!

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:50.900
I give my Heka to Illusion Magician!

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:55.950
Homing Magic Bombardment!

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:12.530
He's no mere spellcaster.

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:22.130
Bakura, I'll defeat you.  Even if I must use all my Heka!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.120
For the Pharaoh.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:30.550
Why do I feel uneasy?

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:52.100
That's Mahad’s tablet shrine.

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:59.400
There’s no wind, but the fire's out.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:08.000
Mahad...

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:15.590
You must be running out of Ba.

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:19.790
Nonsense!  This is just warm-up.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:23.130
Diabound is almost ready to fight.

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:27.100
Then I'll warm you up even more!

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:30.000
And burn you up, body and soul!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.350
Illusion Magician!

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:38.450
Diabound, strike back!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:43.980
My Ka assassin, Shadow Ghoul!

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:49.560
He had another Ka hidden.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:55.310
Shadow Ghoul can pass through walls!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.260
Go, Illusion Magician!

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:00.430
Magical Shockwave!

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:06.480
Shadow Ghoul also attacks!

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:10.810
Diabound!

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:14.380
Slice it up, Shadow Ghoul!

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:18.970
What?

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.590
I won't fall for the same trick twice!

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:29.310
Shadow Ghoul!

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:36.240
Illusion Magician!  Magical Shockwave!

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:42.840
Did I win?

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:46.600
No.  Diabound vanished!

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:54.150
Diabound, destroy Illusion Magician!

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:06.760
Why can it use Shadow Ghoul's ability to pass through walls?

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:15.940
I never told you that Diabound's ability steals the abilities of Ka that it defeats.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.370
What?

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:22.760
A perfect ability for a bandit, wouldn’t you say?

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:26.980
Let me in!

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.320
No!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:33.720
No one's allowed inside until Mahad returns.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:37.520
Hey!  Not cool!

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:38.700
Let her in.

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:40.400
Prince…

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.480
Pharaoh!

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:46.270
As you wish, Pharaoh.

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:54.640
Mana, why did you come to Mahad’s tablet shrine?

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:59.960
I had a dream that my Master was in trouble.

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:04.240
It may be nothing, but I’m too worried to sleep.

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:10.590
I thought if I came here, I could sense what my Master is doing.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:12.960
Mahad in trouble?

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:23.090
The tablet is glowing.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:27.240
Mahad is summoning a Ka!

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:28.550
Prince!

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:37.920
Illusion Magician-

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:40.360
Too late!  Helical Shockwave!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.710
Master!

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.900
Mahad...

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:20.700
Dammit!

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:23.040
What's wrong, Jonouchi?

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:24.880
Look!

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:31.770
I drew symbols on routes that we already took.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.330
You marked our path?

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:35.260
Smart, Jonouchi!

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:38.730
You're drawing graffiti into a soul?

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:46.930
We passed thru here, meaning we're walking in circles.

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:52.780
Yugi, can’t you hear us?  At all?

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:54.050
Jonouchi…

00:10:55.650 --> 00:11:00.090
Yugi, tell us which door is correct!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:03.080
Knock it off, Jonouchi.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:04.380
Be quiet, Anzu!

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:10.180
You don’t care if we're stuck in here and can’t help Yugi?

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:12.760
I didn’t say that!

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.640
Yugi?

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:22.060
What is it, Yugi?

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:23.820
Why...?

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:28.080
When I approach this door, I feel a pain in my chest.

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.570
Yugi?

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:38.720
Is he here?

00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:45.720
Bakura!

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:02.700
What’s with him?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:16.720
Are you okay?

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:18.400
Yeah.

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:26.260
That monster is gone.

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:28.590
So's the room.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:32.800
That's the true enemy that the Pharaoh must fight.

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:37.970
My other self's true enemy?

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:49.440
Spellcaster, you're not strong enough.

00:12:49.440 --> 00:12:53.210
You’re no match for me.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:55.280
I’m on a different level.

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:59.720
Time to end you.

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:07.500
Y-You...

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.980
That's a real trap.

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:12.310
It was there the whole time.

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:16.040
I used my magic so you couldn't see it!

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:18.980
You're so annoying!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:24.180
Bakura, I’m willing to do anything to defeat you!

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:31.890
What?

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:41.830
That was close.

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:44.400
You have some nerve.

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:57.320
Die by your own trap!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.360
Exactly what I was hoping!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:10.230
Diabound, destroy the spellcaster and his Ka!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:12.030
Helical Shockwave!

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:17.000
Pharaoh!

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:22.860
Master…

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:25.310
Mahad, know your limits!

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:28.320
Prince!  Over there!

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:32.320
Mahad is over there?

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:34.630
Not at the Valley of the Kings?

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:41.560
That's the spellcasters' training grounds!

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:43.730
Hold on tight, Mana!

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:23.290
Where’s Mahad?

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:25.530
In the training grounds with Bakura!

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:26.420
What?

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:27.670
Master!

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:30.360
Mana, send word to the palace!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.610
R-Right!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:47.240
Are they immortal?

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:48.570
Mana, climb down!

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:49.720
Okay!

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:52.460
I'll take you on!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:07.720
This battle is over, Mahad.

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:10.850
I’ll be taking that Millennium Ring.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:19.020
Pharaoh, I hoped to see the new world that you’re creating.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:25.960
But I'm willing to offer my life to help you achieve it.

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:40.150
I warned Mahad!

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:45.340
Mahad...

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:52.860
He hasn’t given up.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:58.580
I don't have much Heka left, but I still have some.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:02.200
I’ll show you my forbidden technique!

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:04.140
Forbidden technique?

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:09.260
I'll sacrifice my life to fuse Ka and Ba together!

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:11.260
What?

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.600
Pharaoh…

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:15.890
Mahad!

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:17.180
Don’t worry about me.

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:18.120
Don’t move.

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:21.640
Prince!  Please stop!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:24.160
The future Pharaoh needn’t do this!

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:26.960
There's no difference between me and you.

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:36.940
Pharaoh, my soul shall serve you forever!

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:49.340
Mahad!

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:52.860
Mahad!

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.960
Mahad!

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:02.320
You destroyed yourself.

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:12.270
No way!  Why is his Ka still here?

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:20.390
Was he really able to fuse his Ka and Ba?

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:27.060
Bakura, to bring peace to the people and create the Pharaoh's ideal new world...

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:28.320
...perish!

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:29.760
Whatever!

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:33.490
Diabound, he doesn't know when to die!  End him!

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:35.230
Magical Shockwave!

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:37.830
Helical Shockwave!

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:42.070
What?

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:57.280
Mahad!

00:18:57.280 --> 00:19:00.450
Master!

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:07.100
Mana!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:11.440
Master!

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:13.700
Mana!

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:21.570
No…

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.180
Master!

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.910
Mahad…

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:35.120
This can't be...

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:38.560
What am I sensing?

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:41.500
What's up, Yugi?

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:45.800
The labyrinth is shaking.

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:52.220
Pharaoh!

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:53.820
What's this?

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:59.740
Mahad sacrificed himself.

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:10.630
Pharaoh, my soul shall serve you forever.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.840
Mahad...

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:21.280
My other self’s soul is quivering.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:26.080
Yes.  This labyrinth is the same as his heart.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:29.500
And his heart is lonely.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:35.680
You're the only ones who can lend an ear to his screams of solitude.

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:40.650
I see!  It won't work if we're the ones knocking on the door!

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:44.220
My other self is the one who's knocking!

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:48.860
And we just have to listen for it!

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:50.220
I see!

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:56.940
Then let's focus on listening for the other Yugi’s voice!

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:58.160
Yeah!

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.100
Everyone...

00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:23.220
My other self...

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:25.160
You saw him too, right?

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:26.230
Yeah!

00:21:26.230 --> 00:21:27.500
We’re almost there!

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:28.520
Yeah!

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:39.240
I want to see you.

00:22:00.070 --> 00:22:14.690
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:14.850 --> 00:22:30.410
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:31.130 --> 00:22:36.250
Without a goal in mind

00:22:37.570 --> 00:22:44.820
We just step towards our dream

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:50.460
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:50.650 --> 00:22:58.930
Your eye will find it

00:22:59.290 --> 00:23:04.740
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:12.880
Will touch your soul

00:23:13.070 --> 00:23:16.140
In a duel

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:33.240
Mahad sacrificed himself to make Bakura disappear into the depths of darkness.

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:38.190
But is the battle against Bakura really over?

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:45.330
We found the true door and arrived in the world of Yugi's lost memories.

00:23:45.330 --> 00:23:49.970
But no one here notices us?

00:23:49.970 --> 00:23:52.420
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Blue-Eyed Kisara

00:23:52.420 --> 00:23:54.420
Stay tuned!
